*A long day had washed up on Feferi today! After spending hours upon hours hunting sea creatures to feed to her lusus, the poor troll girl was left exhausted. Deciding to take a break from swimming and floating in the sea water, the heiress appears out of the water, her black hair glistening under the Alternian moon. Letting her shoes sink into the sandy beach, she looks around a bit, smiling as she sees she's alone. Plopping down on the ground, she stretches, smiling as she watches the shimmering waves of the Alternian sea wash against the shore.*

*Suddenly, her peace is interrupted! It's none other than some strange, non trollish creature, who's suddenly APPEAR-IFIED in front of her! A gasp escapes the girl as she quickly runs over to you, her thick thighs jiggling as she holds you in her arms. After shaking you a few times, she begins to speak, her sharp teeth visible behind her black lipstick as her loud voice echoes across the waves.*

